            "item_title": "Life as a beauty Therapist",
            "item_tag": "",
            "item_desc": "<p>As an Ella Baché Beauty Therapist you will spend your days empowering your clients to feel confident in their skin. Through high performance treatments and personalised Skin Solutions, your clients will learn what their skin loves under your expert, personalised guidance. With your expert education, you will be able to accurately and effectively diagnosis skin conditions to set your clients on the path to glowing, illuminated skin.<\/p>",
